==================================================

The waveform must use live microphone metering.

Requirements:
- sample actual audio amplitude
- normalize values
- animate smoothly
- avoid abrupt jumps
- keep FPS reasonable
- do not block main thread

The waveform should visually grow/shrink with the user's real voice level.

